c7b2bdbbe0ab.mp3","entryId":"62317","definition":"快速地跑着过去。","pronunciation":["달려가다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/01d616104d54d8ab97b0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.928,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62317","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":99,"sequenceScore":2.6533,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我正在跑过去，再稍等一会儿吧。","现在几点了？怎么还没到啊？","不过，这条裤子的裤管好像有点窄。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["现在几点了？怎么还没到啊？","不过，这条裤子的裤管好像有点窄。","我正在跑过去，再稍等一会儿吧。"],"answer":2}]}
